{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-01_end","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-01","title":"静候驾临","storyCode":"12-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"dccf160259dc22b1b86049c9c3b7ab9324045dd5ffdf0d02856f42ccbad78fe8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g1_glasgowboxinggym"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，这里暂且安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡铎尔，外面还是一团糟。我们确实已经不在伦蒂尼姆了，老卸货塔的塔顶应该能看到地块外的情况，但我接近不了，那在封锁区外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜就算看到了，也没什么意义，萨卡兹看得很严，他们的人数......相当多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这人怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，想找萨卡兹谈条件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自己看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g1_glasgowboxinggym"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包扎好了，我只能做到这个程度了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......谢谢你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪，为什么......到底发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还能发生什么？萨卡兹已经在伦蒂尼姆城里待了四年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会至今还以为他们是被可怜鬼卡文迪许请过来做客的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"可他们从来都没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们从来都没有什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，你一定是从不出门的贵族老爷，连早餐的瘤奶都需要仆人给你送到餐桌上。嘿，你怎么会沦落到我们诺伯特区来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，我是个学者，只是经济上暂时有些麻烦......只要把手上的书稿写完，应该就能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，我甚至没来得及把稿子带出书房！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝尔德，你真的很擅长找到些落魄鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"请放尊重些，如果顺利，我很有可能是皇家科学院的下一个院士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“很有可能”，哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是不明白，新闻里不总说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“一切太平”。你还想在广播里听到什么？“市民朋友们，很遗憾，伦蒂尼姆如今是个粪坑”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年前派去各个报社和电视台的那些“特别指导专员”可不是白拿工资的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没看过海布里区那些军工厂上现在飘着的是谁的旗帜？那奥克特里格区前几天的那场大火你总该记得吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"可，战争......城防军呢？大公爵们呢？他们不是应该已经在伦蒂尼姆周围保护我们了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么就......萨卡兹们打不过大公爵的，对吧？那些魔族佬不过是一群缩在荒地上的野蛮人，可维多利亚是这片大地上最伟大的国家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁告诉你的？一边在家里吃甜面包一边突然悟到的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我在被条子按在墙上搜身的时候，可从没感觉到过这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，“下个院士”，走吧，你不适合跟我们混在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"可......可我该去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我的公寓不在这片封锁区里，我忠诚的佣人也不知道去哪了......我在这儿谁也不认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会干什么？医疗，缝纫，维修，或者别的什么都好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我的研究方向是纹章学......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们就没有研究把空气变成肉排的学问吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"这个......虽然不是我的学术方向，但可能是有一些难度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝尔德，你不能再捡这些老爷们回来了，他甚至连玩笑都听不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的物资储备毕竟是有限的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......要不，去帮戴菲恩管仓库？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝尔德！你又想把麻烦事都甩给我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我总不能就看着他死在大街上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这种时刻，我们更需要团结。多个人总是多份力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“团结”......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"议会和大公爵们该向你们学学这点，否则我们也不会沦落到今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们怎么不团结？在吊死国王这件事上就团结得很呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时......唉，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿你能派上点用场，“下个院士”先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定尽力！不过，说起来......你们是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，欢迎来到“揍歪下巴”拳馆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以喊我们格拉斯哥帮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾告诉我，和平一定会再次到来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我没法再用虚假的希望欺骗自己，我没法再躲进房间中，假装我们所做的一切仍然有意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，或许我们可以试着用一种更加长远的眼光，“历史的维度”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，和平会到来，和平终会到来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而战争，也一定会更加残忍地击碎它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾相信我们能赢，我依然恳求我们能赢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，海蒂，如果我们所做的一切，最终只是些自我安慰和自我宽解......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是如果。或许这已经是事实......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些书本，这几张课桌，这个摇摇欲坠的学校......怎么能对抗一个时代？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂，我没办法......我几乎没办法继续坚持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我该怎么办？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁女士，您还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉......你回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在写信吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这些什么也不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......突然想起了几本以前看过的小说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主角往往是风流倜傥的军官，穿着得体的军服，叼着烟斗奔赴前线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但作者永远都不会告诉我们，到底是哪一片战场，战壕里的气味又是怎样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恋慕着主人公的先生或者小姐们聚在一起，吃着精致的茶点，怀着一颗惴惴不安的心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我们都知道，这只是些文学技巧，最终的结局总是团圆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍有追求的作者会试图营造一种被这里的评论家们称作“深刻”的氛围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"故事中会点缀着一些可控的死亡，往往是主人公的战友，他们为了掩护英雄倒在了前线的壕沟里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最终，那些凶残的敌人会被主人公手刃，正义与道德再一次得到彰显。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在战友哀伤的葬礼上，代表荣耀的花瓣洒满棺椁，人群肃穆，献上总结他们伟大事业的悼词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此刻是绝佳的煽情点，主人公们会手握着手，擦去泪花，坚定地望向天边的朝阳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会说，希望终会来临，一切牺牲都有意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，作者可以在这里停下了，真正美好的未来就交给读者们去想象吧，最后的庄严感足够让他们满足了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您居然还读过这样的小说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是很多年前了，谁没有经历过那样的年纪呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我还是个少女的时候，一度十分迷恋这些书......我并不对主人公们抱有太多感情，但那些死亡确实让我迷恋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我偶尔会想象自己是那位为事业献上生命的英雄，人们含着眼泪，夸赞我所创造的时代，或者，最起码，称颂我的牺牲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，很幼稚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再后来，我自以为自己已经足够清醒，足够看穿这些裹着糖霜的幻想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我开始发现......我与当年，或许没有本质上的不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说，您以前和孩子们说过，死亡是个严肃的话题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，是吗？我不记得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概只是些我习以为常的老套说教吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的采购顺利吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，街上的情况并没有很糟，商店里的东西也没有涨价。只是城防军好像比以往多了些。萨卡兹士兵们......也不再遮遮掩掩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，大家都在假装什么都没有发生。除了......原本是诺伯特区的地方，如今只剩下周围区块延伸过来的支撑骨架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些地方呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉，我要再次向你道歉，我不该把你牵扯进这些事里，只是......莱托已经盯上了我，每次我出门都有几个不怀好意的人跟着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能赌一把，赌你还不在他们的监视名单上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我很高兴能为伦蒂尼姆的大家出一份力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，您所说的几个地点，现在都冷冷清清的，那些接头暗号我都用了，也没有人回应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许......也许他们已经放弃了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他们比我坚强得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我发现了一封信，应该是留给您的，我没拆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......不，这不是他们的笔迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......信里详细写了自救军情报交换站的几乎全部信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说什么？！可是，怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一次威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......对我们掌握得很彻底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......戈尔丁女士，那我们该怎么办？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉，我会再给你一份地点列表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并没有直接去过这些据点，但我分析过情报的流向，他们......应该就在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不该这么冒险，这违反了工作守则，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这消息对自救军很重要，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这关乎很多人的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们就应该去做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......茉莉，像我教你的那样，留意所有可能的尾随者，不论跟着你的人是不是萨卡兹，都不要掉以轻心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那里找到一个叫克洛维希娅的女孩，或者任何能联系到克洛维希娅的人，告诉他们，整个情报网泄露了，他们需要马上转移！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁女士，您要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱托的办公室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会尽量为你们争取时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我不会有事的，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿我比自己想象的要强大。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我做了一个梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我梦见......阴云笼罩了这座城市，沾血的萨卡兹旗帜在每一座建筑上空飘扬，而城外......源石簇长满了目力所及的每一个角落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我梦见锈色的王座在大地上矗立，人们跪拜，流下黑色的眼泪；我梦见王座上的人轻挥手臂，呐喊声便刺破了整片天空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，王座的阴影里，瑟缩的人们悄悄抬起头......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感受到他们的感情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知该怎么描述......那么驳杂，那么压抑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能辨别出浮在最表面的那些，那种痛苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有仇恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王座上的人......是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是萨卡兹众魂预见的未来吗？还是，一位魔王的使命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅小姐是不是也做过这个梦？会不会......这就是她现在所期盼的场景？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，这个梦......它什么都不是，对吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你最近太累了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"梦只是梦而已。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢你，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，那只是一个梦......而已......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生好些了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不上好，她的身体......本就称得上瘦弱。伤口很深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闪灵已经尝试了几种办法，但效果都很有限，她还没有苏醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr看起来在缓慢地自我修复，我们同样不知道它能恢复到什么程度，乃至它是否能真正恢复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士，城防军指挥塔上，如果我能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"每个人都已经做到了最好。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"谁也不会想到特雷西斯会出现在那里。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从没想过，有一天凯尔希医生居然会伤得这么重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她总是会游刃有余地处理好一切问题，她总能给我们提供最恰当的建议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她可是凯尔希医生，我甚至从没看到过她疲惫的样子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，现在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（牵住阿米娅的手）","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我会担负起我的责任。罗德岛在这里的使命还远没有结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在......我想再去看看凯尔希医生，可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是在她的床边坐一会儿也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位，相比于陪护重伤员，你们现在有更重要的工作要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔让我告诉你们，城防军指挥塔上的那些数据已经解析完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅正在召集一场会议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要重新评估伦蒂尼姆的局势了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"战争爆发了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们的初步计划失败了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，告诉我们，下一步应该怎么做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
